      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2881887645722
    m_Localized: "Tho\xE1t game?\nTi\u1EBFn tr\xECnh t\u1EEB l\u1EA7n l\u01B0u cu\u1ED1i s\u1EBD m\u1EA5t."
